; Every form of zhang's budget directives: a date, or a date and a time to the second or to the minute; metadata on
; each directive; decimal, negative and computed amounts; inline comments; budget names with digits, dashes and
; underscores; a quoted budget name in the `budget` metadata; and the budget directives in an included file.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "Asia/Shanghai"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY

include "budgets.zhang"

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Groceries
  budget: Groceries
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Books
  budget: "Books"
  note: "a quoted budget name"

2024-01-05 * "Market" "weekly shopping"
  Expenses:Groceries 123.45 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-06 10:30 * "Bookshop" "a novel, at a time to the minute"
  Expenses:Books 58 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-02-10 * "Market" "a refund"
  Expenses:Groceries -20.05 CNY
  Assets:Bank
